== Walkthrough ==

Your Location is 554.97, -122.60, 3.18

You say, 'Hail, Jusean Evanesque'

: Jusean Evanesque says 'Why, hello there, ______! I am Jusean, loyal member of the League of Antonican Bards. You look like the reliable sort, maybe you could help me out for a bit, huh? It's about time for our field agents to turn in their [watch reports], and I need someone to go pick them up for me.'

You say, 'What watch reports?'

: Jusean Evanesque says 'We always have someone stationed on watch duty at the two main entries to the city to keep an eye on what is happening around Qeynos. We have [Anehan and Behroe] down at the docks, and [Leanon and Quinon] working the North Gate.'

You say, 'Who are Anehan and Behroe?'

: Jusean Evanesque says 'Here, if you take this to Anehan or Behroe down at the docks, and then return their report to me as soon as you can, I will give you a small reward.'

You receive Jusean's Report Request (identifies as "Dock Watch Report Request").

Your Location is -191.61, -130.41, 3.13

You say, 'Hail, Behroe Dlexon'

: Behroe Dlexon says 'Ah, greetings, ______! How are you this evening? Hopefully, you are faring much better than I. I'm stuck on the night watch here, and never get to see my lovely [Aenia]. Ah, she is so sweet. I wrote her this beautiful [ballad], but I fear she may never hear it.'

Give him Jusean's Report Request.

: Behroe Dlexon yawns and says, 'Oh, report time already again? Yeah, here ya go, ______. Be careful around here at night, I've been seeing some rough looking characters lurking about.'
